<h2>When the Books Were Written</h2>

<p>
  The New Testament was not written in the order it is bound. James likely
  came first and Revelation last, with Paul's letters spilling out of the
  journeys and imprisonments charted above. Wide bars mean genuine scholarly
  uncertainty, not slow writing.
</p>

